# Access

Accesses the project depends on. Secrets are never stored here.
Expiry is a date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format or `never`.

| Access | Owner | Where secrets live | Expires |
|---|---|---|---|
| Code hosting (GitHub repository) | | | never |
| CI token | | | YYYY-MM-DD |
| Renovate GitHub App on the repository | | GitHub App settings | never |
{%- if report_schedule != 'off' %}
| Report GitHub App: Contents read and write, Pull requests read and write, Administration read, Checks read, Commit statuses read, Dependabot alerts read | | GitHub Actions secrets `REPORT_APP_CLIENT_ID`, `REPORT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` | never |
{%- endif %}
{%- if level == 'full' and report_schedule != 'off' %}
| Scheduled Claude task for reports | | | never |
{%- endif %}
